# Navigation UI

- Use Expo Router for navigation
- Keep route files lightweight
- Keep business logic outside routes
- Prefer `_layout.tsx` files for stacks and tabs
- Prefer route groups for organization and clean URLs
- Prefer Protected Routes for authentication flows
- Prefer consistent headers and screen transitions
- Respect safe area in navigation layouts
- Prefer modal presentation for temporary flows
- Keep tab navigation simple and predictable
- Avoid deeply nested navigation structures
- Ensure navigation gestures and back behavior feel natural
